  "fixtures": "fixtures/06-images/src: 8 PNG sources = 4 bundled scikit-image sample photos (astronaut NASA PD 512x512, chelsea CC0 451x300, coffee CC0 600x400, rocket SpaceX PD 640x427; no pooch downloads) + 3 synthetic text-on-photo banners (SVG text composited with sharp) + 1 flat product-box render (SVG rasterised). SUBSTITUTE for the team's product photos. fixtures/06-images/seeded: noise_fine.png (S1) + 2 control copies; fixtures/06-images/control: 2 clean images. KEY.json lists sources, licences, S1 and controls.",
